    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olmonekie lo loiboni le Nkai lemeishopo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa te ilo ari oewunye ilo kitok le njore, oirriwua Sargon ilo aiguanani le Asiria meeu Ashdod, neitainye olarrabal neya ninye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore te ina kata neirorie Olaitoriani Isaya olayioni le Amos, ejo, “Shomo, talaku ilo kuniyia lirrotianita te mpolos nidotu inamuka too nkejek inono,” netaasa apa ninye ina alo meishopo nemeeta namuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Olaitoriani, “Ore anaa enashomo osinka lai Isaya meishopo nemeeta namuka too larin okuni anaa olmonekie le ngolon ogilunore Misiri, o Etiopia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejia naa elo atiu olaiguanani le Asiria erikoo lelo le Misiri ootarayioki o le Etiopia epuo eyararoto. Ore ndung'ot pokira ilooti o lkituaak nepuo meishopo nemeeta namuka. Nemeeta toki too ltuli neaku enkurruna e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keitukurruni ninche te nkaraki Etiopia naisiligie osiligi lenye Misiri natawuasare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo oomanya olomanaa le naiposha nepuo kenya aajo te ina olong, ‘Ng'ura, ena nataase te kuldo laa ninche apa kisiliga, naa ninche kisikakitia aaing'oru, eretoto pee ekordu iyiook aitung'uaa ilo aiguanani le Asiria! Naa amaa, iyiook, kaji kinko pee kiimisho?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
